213
00:13:24,245 --> 00:13:27,267
Values kabhi print nahi hoti, sirf ginti.

214
00:13:27,617 --> 00:13:33,158
Aur aakhri do checks, dot gitignore aur
git repository, lesson teen ke liye hain.

215
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:39,794
run checks saare chhe checks order mein
chalata hai, aur main har result ki ek line

216
00:13:39,794 --> 00:13:40,823
print karta hai.

217
00:13:41,173 --> 00:13:42,538
Output dekho.

218
00:13:42,758 --> 00:13:48,598
Python version theek, venv active,
package installed aur version match, dot env mein

219
00:13:48,598 --> 00:13:51,380
teeno settings, aur gitignore bhi theek.

220
00:13:51,730 --> 00:13:54,445
Lekin ek check fail: Git repository.

221
00:13:54,665 --> 00:13:56,842
Folder abhi git repo nahi hai.

222
00:13:57,062 --> 00:14:00,401
Checker hi bata raha hai
ki fix kya hai: git init.

223
00:14:00,751 --> 00:14:03,531
Paanch mein se paanch
nahi, chhe mein se paanch.

224
00:14:03,751 --> 00:14:06,048
Isliye exit code one, failure.

225
00:14:06,268 --> 00:14:10,262
Lesson teen ke end tak hum
isse chhe mein se chhe banayenge.

226
00:14:11,562 --> 00:14:13,021
Interview corner.

227
00:14:13,241 --> 00:14:18,443
Pehla question: Python projects
virtual environments kyun use karte hain?

228
00:14:20,793 --> 00:14:26,360
Answer: har project ke packages aur
versions ko isolate karne ke liye, taaki

229
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,705
projects ek doosre ko na todein.

230
00:14:28,925 --> 00:14:35,374
Aur taaki requirements dot txt se kisi
bhi machine par exact same setup ban sake.

231
00:14:35,594 --> 00:14:39,283
Trap: yeh bolna ki venv
Python ko fast banata hai.

232
00:14:39,503 --> 00:14:43,489
Venv sirf yeh badalta hai
ki kaunse packages use honge.

233
00:14:43,839 --> 00:14:47,242
Doosra: kya aap dot
venv folder commit karte ho?

234
00:14:49,592 --> 00:14:50,875
Answer: nahi.

235
00:14:51,095 --> 00:14:54,925
Recipe commit karo,
yaani requirements dot txt.

236
00:14:55,145 --> 00:15:00,994
Dot venv ko ignore karo, kyunki woh bada
hai, machine specific hai, aur dobara ban

237
00:15:00,994 --> 00:15:01,707
sakta hai.

238
00:15:01,927 --> 00:15:07,078
Trap: yeh sochna ki dot venv
commit karne se teammates ka time bachega.

239
00:15:07,298 --> 00:15:12,118
Doosre operating system ya
Python version par woh toot jaata hai.

240
00:15:12,468 --> 00:15:16,863
Teesra: Python project mein
API keys kaise handle karte ho?

241
00:15:19,213 --> 00:15:22,186
Answer: environment
variables se padhte hain.

242
00:15:22,406 --> 00:15:28,351
Development mein ek git ignored dot env
file se, aur production mein secrets manager

243
00:15:28,351 --> 00:15:28,563
se.

244
00:15:28,783 --> 00:15:34,210
Git mein sirf dot env dot example
jaati hai, naam aur placeholders ke saath.

245
00:15:34,430 --> 00:15:38,835
Key ki value kabhi print ya log
nahi karte, aur leak ho toh revoke.

246
00:15:39,055 --> 00:15:41,951
Trap: bas abhi ke liye
key code mein likh dena.

247
00:15:42,171 --> 00:15:44,436
Woh git history mein reh jaati hai.

248
00:15:45,736 --> 00:15:46,993
Practice time.

249
00:15:47,213 --> 00:15:49,337
Pause karo aur khud try karo.

250
00:15:49,687 --> 00:15:51,812
Pehla: ek naya terminal kholo.

251
00:15:52,032 --> 00:15:54,001
Kya venv ab bhi active hai?

252
00:15:54,221 --> 00:15:55,805
Kaise check karoge?

253
00:15:56,155 --> 00:16:02,332
Doosra: requests package ko exact
version ke saath install karo, aur requirements

254
00:16:02,332 --> 00:16:03,857
dot txt update karo.

255
00:16:04,207 --> 00:16:09,766
Teesra: dot env dot example aur dot
env mein GREETING naam ki setting jodo, aur

256
00:16:09,766 --> 00:16:11,595
hello dot py se use padho.

257
00:16:11,945 --> 00:16:17,395
Aur scenario: aapka app chalta hai,
lekin teammate ke laptop par module not found

258
00:16:17,395 --> 00:16:18,404
error aata hai.

259
00:16:18,624 --> 00:16:20,139
Kyun, aur fix kya hai?

260
00:16:27,439 --> 00:16:28,368
Quick check.

261
00:16:28,588 --> 00:16:34,002
Teammate ko aapka environment dobara
banane ke liye kaunsi file commit karni

262
00:16:34,002 --> 00:16:34,572
chahiye?

263
00:16:40,272 --> 00:16:42,549
C, requirements dot txt.

264
00:16:42,769 --> 00:16:44,196
Woh recipe hai.

265
00:16:44,416 --> 00:16:50,482
Dot venv usi se banta hai, dot env
private hai, aur pycache Python khud banata hai.

266
00:16:51,782 --> 00:16:54,053
Doosra question, thoda tricky.

267
00:16:54,273 --> 00:16:59,562
Environment se DEBUG ki value string
False aayi. bool of string False kya hoga?

268
00:17:05,262 --> 00:17:05,997
True!

269
00:17:06,217 --> 00:17:08,806
Koi bhi non empty string True hoti hai.

270
00:17:09,026 --> 00:17:13,309
Isliye show config dot py
text ko true se compare karta hai.

271
00:17:14,609 --> 00:17:15,449
Recap.

272
00:17:15,669 --> 00:17:19,839
Dot venv har project ka
apna Python aur packages hai.

273
00:17:20,189 --> 00:17:23,800
Banao, activate karo,
aur kaam ke baad deactivate.

274
00:17:24,150 --> 00:17:30,135
pip se exact versions install karo,
freeze se recipe likho, aur dash r se dobara

275
00:17:30,135 --> 00:17:30,584
banao.

276
00:17:30,934 --> 00:17:35,492
Settings aur secrets
environment variables mein, dot env file se.

277
00:17:35,842 --> 00:17:40,152
Dot env dot example commit
hoti hai, dot env kabhi nahi.

278
00:17:40,372 --> 00:17:42,462
Aur leak hui key turant revoke.

279
00:17:42,812 --> 00:17:45,079
Agle lesson mein Git aur GitHub.

280
00:17:45,299 --> 00:17:51,001
Hum project ko save karenge, uski
history dekhenge, GitHub par bhejenge, aur setup

281
00:17:51,001 --> 00:17:54,130
checker ko chhe mein
se chhe tak le jaayenge.

282
00:17:55,430 --> 00:17:57,134
Lesson do complete.

283
00:17:57,354 --> 00:18:02,501
Ab aapka har project apne toolbox
ke saath, aur secrets code se bahar.

284
00:18:02,721 --> 00:18:04,609
Milte hain lesson teen mein.
